  "observations": [
    "Both mode image sets show a normal-size held weapon; the R2 oversized default-sprite obstruction is absent.",
    "All three deliberately scrolled module cards and all three summary-row views are readable, with fixed BACK unobscured. Prerequisites, no-direct-heal and no-extra-damage trade-offs are explicit.",
    "Pin gold marker and white target-focus brackets remain visually distinct in normal and reduced snapshots; consumed and invalid/pruned snapshots have no persistent gold square.",
    "Normal and reduced field snapshots show two finite circular areas; expired snapshots remove the left area but retain a player-centered circle.",
    "Winch snapshots show HP 50 before collection and 58 after collection; the medical-prerequisite summary remains explicit.",
    "Build and pause overlays cover the world and expose their controls without the oversized sprite. Shop/upgrade views remain readable."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Cooldown/prerequisite-named snapshots remain at the weapons top of the inventory, not the live summary: they do not visually prove the cooldown label.",
    "Static Winch images do not independently prove the pull trajectory; the small orb may overlap the player/weapon. Position, batching and collection semantics require the separately audited telemetry.",
    "The residual player-centered circle in expired-field snapshots prevents a claim that all circular visuals disappear; exact field cleanup is a telemetry claim.",
    "Screenshots alone do not prove input isolation, action ordering, internal cleanup or a complete motion sequence.",
    "This review excludes prior R2 images, separate cards gate and ordinary play. R1/R2 failures and R2 visual deficiency remain retained."
  ],
  "source_mutated": false,
  "engine_launched": false
}
